      "html": "<div class=\"post__content post__content--new-editor\"><p>Hi:</p><p>VL53L8CX can’t support to program FOV. We only have a few that can be supported, such as VL53L1CX/CB. The API interfaces are as follows for your reference</p><p><a href=\"https://www.st.com/resource/en/user_manual/um2510-a-guide-to-using-the-vl53l1x-ultra-lite-driver-stmicroelectronics.pdf\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">A guide to using the VL53L1X ultra lite driver - User manual</a></p><figure><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://uploads-eu-west-1.insided.com/stmicroelectronics-en/attachment/6f41cc86-5643-4567-a7f4-faba3a70cfea.png\"/></figure><p> </p><p>Best regards,</p><p>Bin FAN</p></div>"
